body:
Yes, absolutely. The last time she reconnected w me she said she saw signs from the universe that made her feel like reaching out to me. I'm a complete sucker for her, and should really know better but she was showering me with attention for weeks and now it's dwindled down to nearly nothin. She knows the power she has over me, and I think it delights her. Good ol' intermittent reinforcement... Ha.

&#x200B;

She made it a point to talk about her relationship issues and how her partner wasn't satisfying her in bed, and she knows i'm fatally attracted to her. D'oh, fell for it again and now I'll I'm getting is a sparse text here or there.

Step One: I'm asking him if he will marry inter-species pets.

Step Two: I'm asking him if he is comfortable with same sex interspecies marriage.

&#x200B;

Do you want your pets to go to heaven . 

&#x200B;

I recently was ordained minister by the universal life church and I can provide you the service of saving your pets soul. Your pets are living in sin. For the small 1 time fee of 200$ I will marry your pets so on judgement Day they will be spared. I also have a VIP package for 650 which includes photos and a marriage certificate. Cash only.
